                    <p class="text-14-150 opacity-80">Our process emphasizes thorough research and concept exploration. We believe in the power of references, even from different industries, to inspire unique designs that resonate with your target audience. Our approach involves extensive testing and iteration, allowing for quick feedback and concept evolution.</p>
                  </div>
                </nav>
              </div>
              <div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" data-w-id="16bdd7f2-f178-dc89-1aa3-d17e63ce0acc" class="dropdown-faq w-dropdown">
                <div class="dropdown-top w-dropdown-toggle">
                  <p class="text-14-150">How do you handle the challenges of articulating brand style?</p>
                  <div data-is-ix2-target="1" class="ic-plus-faq" data-w-id="16bdd7f2-f178-dc89-1aa3-d17e63ce0ad0" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/62581cacf7654a9838775673/62581cacf7654a49f0775692_plus.json" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="0.5" data-duration="0" data-loading="eager"></div>
                </div>
                <nav style="height:0px" class="dropdown-list-faq w-dropdown-list">
                  <div class="wrapper-text-faq">
                    <p class="text-14-150 opacity-80">We understand that language often limits our ability to convey abstract ideas. That&#x27;s why our team of designers is skilled in researching and articulating the design style best suited to your business, bridging the gap between concept and visual representation.</p>
                  </div>
                </nav>
              </div>
              <div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" data-w-id="cd51e8db-4393-5835-0273-3b02d3c11142" class="dropdown-faq w-dropdown">
                <div class="dropdown-top w-dropdown-toggle">
                  <p class="text-14-150">Why should we focus on comprehensive brand identity rather than just a logo?</p>
                  <div data-is-ix2-target="1" class="ic-plus-faq" data-w-id="cd51e8db-4393-5835-0273-3b02d3c11146" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/62581cacf7654a9838775673/62581cacf7654a49f0775692_plus.json" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="0.5" data-duration="0" data-loading="eager"></div>
                </div>
                <nav style="height:0px" class="dropdown-list-faq w-dropdown-list">
                  <div class="wrapper-text-faq">
                    <p class="text-14-150 opacity-80">A thorough and well-organized set of brand assets streamlines creativity across your business. It facilitates easier outsourcing of video production, web design, and content creation without lengthy back-and-forth communication. Our approach provides you with a robust, easy-to-use set of rules and assets that work cohesively across all aspects of your business.</p>
                  </div>
                </nav>
              </div>
              <div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" data-w-id="f244105a-4a61-59de-8011-4f0ff09f2ed2" class="dropdown-faq w-dropdown">
                <div class="dropdown-top w-dropdown-toggle">
                  <p class="text-14-150">What does a modern brand identity package include?</p>
                  <div data-is-ix2-target="1" class="ic-plus-faq" data-w-id="f244105a-4a61-59de-8011-4f0ff09f2ed6" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/62581cacf7654a9838775673/62581cacf7654a49f0775692_plus.json" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="0.5" data-duration="0" data-loading="eager"></div>
                </div>
                <nav style="height:0px" class="dropdown-list-faq w-dropdown-list">
                  <div class="wrapper-text-faq">
                    <p class="text-14-150 opacity-80">Our modern brand identity packages include ready-to-use assets for video production (motion graphics), graphics suitable for UI and graphic designers, color palettes, fonts, and logos in various accessible formats, and editable templates for quick customization. We offer different levels of brand identity packages to suit various needs and budgets.</p>
                  </div>
                </nav>
              </div>
              <div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" data-w-id="54189702-6ea1-827f-e633-9fd40d3691b6" class="dropdown-faq w-dropdown">
                <div class="dropdown-top w-dropdown-toggle">
                  <p class="text-14-150">How does your service differ from traditional brand design agencies?</p>
                  <div data-is-ix2-target="1" class="ic-plus-faq" data-w-id="54189702-6ea1-827f-e633-9fd40d3691ba" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/62581cacf7654a9838775673/62581cacf7654a49f0775692_plus.json" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="0.5" data-duration="0" data-loading="eager"></div>
                </div>
                <nav style="height:0px" class="dropdown-list-faq w-dropdown-list">
                  <div class="wrapper-text-faq">
                    <p class="text-14-150 opacity-80">Unlike agencies that focus solely on graphic design, we create contemporary brand identity packages suitable for video, events, product development, and more. Our service often involves enhancing existing branding work, ensuring it&#x27;s suitable for all aspects of your business and marketing efforts.</p>
                  </div>
                </nav>
              </div>
              <div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" data-w-id="366167f2-180a-b268-8960-52294bd22e59" class="dropdown-faq w-dropdown">
                <div class="dropdown-top w-dropdown-toggle">
                  <p class="text-14-150">Can you work with our existing brand elements?</p>
                  <div data-is-ix2-target="1" class="ic-plus-faq" data-w-id="366167f2-180a-b268-8960-52294bd22e5d" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/62581cacf7654a9838775673/62581cacf7654a49f0775692_plus.json" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="0.5" data-duration="0" data-loading="eager"></div>
                </div>
                <nav style="height:0px" class="dropdown-list-faq w-dropdown-list">
                  <div class="wrapper-text-faq">
                    <p class="text-14-150 opacity-80">Absolutely. While we can provide stand-alone brand conception, it&#x27;s more common for us to enhance and build upon your existing work. We can subtly improve your brand identity and ensure it&#x27;s ready for various applications, from updating sales collateral to creating brand motion graphics and applying branding to UI, web, and video.</p>
                  </div>
                </nav>
              </div>
